# Restless Spire enters tapped on turn 1. On turn 3 Bot1 pays {U}{R} with Mox Sapphire and Mox Ruby and animates it: until end of turn it is a 2/1 blue and red Elemental
# land creature with "During your turn, this creature has first strike" (CR 613.1d, 613.4b, 613.1f, 702.7). It attacks: "Whenever this land attacks, scry 1" (CR 701.22):
# Bot1 sees Black Lotus and puts it on the bottom, so the card it draws on turn 5 is Counterspell. Bot2's Llanowar Elves blocks and dies to the first-strike damage before
# it deals any: the Spire is undamaged. On turn 4 the effect is gone: it is only a Land again.

